114
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:53,360
nation, gentile or Jew, Christian or

115
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:55,360
heathen. as to the rest of my theology I

116
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:58,400
need not impose upon the patients of the

